 <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:8pt; font-family:ARIAL;text-align:justify">As of December&#160;31, 2025, the agreed closing conditions for 10 assignment agreements were satisfied. </p> <p style="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:8pt; font-family:ARIAL;text-align:justify">During 2024, the agreed closing conditions for the following exploitation concessions were satisfied: </p> <p style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
