<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:8pt; font-family:ARIAL;text-align:justify">Reduction of flaring through operational efficiencies and expansion of associated evacuation and processing capacity. </p></td></tr></table>
