<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:8pt; font-family:ARIAL;text-align:justify">Reduction of fugitive emissions, through methane Leak Detection and Repair (&#8220;LDAR&#8221;) campaigns and pilots with new technologies. </p></td></tr></table>
<table style="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:ARIAL; font-size:8pt;border-spacing:0;width:100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
