<td style="width:1%;vertical-align:top">&#160;</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:ARIAL; font-size:8pt;text-align:justify">Strengthening the safety culture, with a focus on prevention, visible leadership, and the active participation of operational employees. </p></td></tr></table>
