<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:ARIAL; font-size:8pt;text-align:justify">Centralizing the safety function, promoting regulatory consistency, data traceability, and comprehensive oversight. </p></td></tr></table>
<table style="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:ARIAL; font-size:8pt;border-spacing:0;width:100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
