;404 of the Sarbanes-Oxley Act. These regulations provide, among other requirements that, along with the annual audit, a report must be presented by our management relating to the design, maintenance and periodic evaluation of the internal control over financial reporting system and be accompanied by a report from our external auditor. Several of our departments are involved in this activity, including the internal audit department. </p>
