 <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:8pt; font-family:ARIAL;text-align:justify">At its meeting held on August&#160;18, 2025, the Board of Directors of YPF S.A., effective as of August&#160;19, 2025, approved the following changes: </p> <p style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
