<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:ARIAL; font-size:8pt;text-align:justify">Within the framework of the Company&#8217;s &#8220;YPF 4&#215;4&#8221; plan and considering YPF&#8217;s need to focus on the excellence and effectiveness of its administrative processes while simultaneously addressing the challenges related to strategic projects and their financing, the functions centralized in the CFO Vice Presidency were divided, and the Administration and Reporting Vice Presidency headed by Juan Jos&#233; Mata, and Finance Vice Presidency headed by Pedro Luis Kearney were created. </p></td></tr></table>
