<td style="width:2%">&#160;</td>
<td style="width:3%;vertical-align:top;text-align:left">(3)</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:7pt; font-family:ARIAL;text-align:justify">According to data provided by The Bank of New York Mellon, as of March&#160;9, 2026, there were 97,071,609 ADSs outstanding and 30 ADR holders on record. Such ADRs represented 24.7% of the total number of issued and outstanding Class&#160;D shares as of such date. Since some of these ADRs are held by nominees, the number of record holders may not be representative of the number of beneficial owners. In addition, as of March 9, 2026, there were 63,979,330 Class D Shares issued and outstanding that are traded on BYMA. </p></td></tr></table>
<table style="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:ARIAL; font-size:7pt;border-spacing:0;width:100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
