<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:ARIAL; font-size:8pt;text-align:justify">The Audit Committee of YPF S.A. must <span style="white-space:nowrap">pre-approve</span> all audit and <span style="white-space:nowrap">non-audit</span> services to be provided to YPF S.A. or, where applicable, any of its subsidiaries by the external auditor of YPF S.A. </p></td></tr></table>
