 such agreement, YPF acquired 100% of the shares and capital stock of Mobil Argentina S.A. (&#8220;MASA&#8221;). </div> <div style="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL;text-align:justify">MASA owns <ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:ProportionOfOwnershipInterestInSubsidiary" contextRef="P12_17_2024To12_17_2024_SierraChataMemberifrsfullSignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis" unitRef="Unit_pure" decimals="4" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-122305">54.45</ix:nonFraction>% of Sierra Chata unconventional exploitation concession in the Province of Neuqu&#233;n. Pampa Energ&#237;a S.A., operator of such concession, owns the remaining working interest. </div> <div style="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL;text-align:justify">On January&#160;29, 2025 (&#8220;acquisition date&#8221;), after the fulfillment of the closing conditions, the sale and transfer by the Sellers to YPF of <ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:ProportionOfOwnershipInterestInSubsidiary" contextRef="P01_29_2025To01_29_2025_MobilArgentinaSaMemberifrsfullSignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis" unitRef="Unit_pure" decimals="2" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-122306">100</ix:nonFraction>% of MASA&#8217;s shares and capital stock was completed. The amount of the transaction was <ix:nonFraction name="ifrs-full:AcquisitiondateFairValueOfTotalConsiderationTransferred" contextRef="PAsOn01_29_2025_MobilArgentinaSaMemberifrsfullSignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis" unitRef="Unit_USD" decimals="-6" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-122307">327</ix:nonFraction> in cash. As of the acquisition date, MASA will continue to operate under the corporate name SC Gas S.A.U., being YPF its sole shareholder. </div> <div style="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL;text-align:justify">The transaction described above qualifies as a business combination in accordance with IFRS 3 and is accounted for using the acquisition method (see Note 2.b.1)). <ix:nonNumeric name="ypf:DisclosureOfFairValuesOfTheIdentifiableassetsAcquiredAndtheliabilitiesAssumedTableTextBlock" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025_MobilArgentinaSaMemberifrsfullBusinessCombinationsAxis" escape="true" continuedAt="TextSelection_158894234" id="ixv-122308">The following table details the consideration transferred, the fair values of the identifiable assets acquired and the liabilities assumed by YPF at the acquisition date: </ix:nonNumeric></div> <ix:continuation id="TextSelection_158894234"><div style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div>
