gInterestInSubsidiary" contextRef="PAsOn06_02_2025_CerroPiedraCerroGuadalNorteBarrancaYankowskyLosMonosElGuadalLomasdelCuyCaadnVascoCaadnYatelPicoTruncadoElCordnLosPeralesLasMesetasCaadnLenMesetaEspinosaandCaadndelaEscondidaLasHerasMemberifrsfullSignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis" unitRef="Unit_pure" decimals="2" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-123989">100</ix:nonFraction>% of the working interest in the aforementioned exploitation and transportation concessions. The transfer was approved by Decree No.&#160;539/2025 published in the Official Gazette of the Province of Santa Cruz on June&#160;18, 2025. </div> <div style="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL;text-align:justify">On June&#160;19, 2025, YPF and Fomicruz executed the notarial deed, thereby formalizing and perfecting the aforementioned assignment. Additionally, YPF and Fomicruz signed a transitory operation agreement for all the assigned exploitation concessions until December 2025. </div> <div style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div>
