<td colspan="5" style="vertical-align:top"> <div style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 8pt; font-family: ARIAL; font-weight: bold; line-height: normal;">NOTES TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</div> <div style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 1pt; font-size: 8pt; font-family: ARIAL; font-weight: bold; line-height: normal;">AS OF DECEMBER 31, 2025, 2024 AND 2023</div> </td> </tr> </table> </ix:exclude></ix:continuation> <ix:continuation id="TextSelectionAppend_158897054_64" continuedAt="TextSelectionAppend_158897054_65"><div style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:8pt; font-family:ARIAL"><ix:exclude>(Amounts expressed in millions of United States dollars, except shares and per shares amounts expressed in United States dollars, and as otherwise indicated)</ix:exclude> </div> <div style="margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL;font-weight:bold"><ix:exclude>35. MAIN REGULATIONS (cont.)</ix:exclude> </div> <div style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt ; font-size:8pt">&#160;</div> <div style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:9pt; font-family:ARIAL;text-align:justify">Among the main regulations aimed at encouraging the use of renewable energy, the following stand out: </div> <div style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="text-align:start; BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:ARIAL; font-size:9pt;border-spacing:0;width:100%">
